Package: mlr3L0Learn
Title: 'mlr3' Learner for L0-Regularized Regression via 'L0Learn'
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Aymane", "Aboulhouda", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "aymane.aboulhouda@usherbrooke.ca")
Description: Provides a regression learner for the 'mlr3' framework that
    wraps best subset selection with L0, L0L1 and L0L2 penalties from the
    'L0Learn' package (Hazimeh and Mazumder, 2020, <doi:10.1287/opre.2019.1919>).
    The penalty parameters are selected by cross-validation inside
    'L0Learn::L0Learn.cvfit()'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/AymaneJoestar/mlr3L0Learn
